WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:11.640
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.980 --> 00:24.460
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.560 --> 00:31.560
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.390 --> 00:39.760
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.070
If my wish comes true...

00:43.070 --> 00:49.820
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.820 --> 00:56.540
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.540 --> 01:06.050
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.080
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.370 --> 01:23.760
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:35.770 --> 01:37.380
Yo, Aruke...

01:38.360 --> 01:39.950
Lord Gerot...

01:39.950 --> 01:43.040
it's been raining continuously for three days, including today.

01:43.930 --> 01:48.100
In our country, this is like Aruke's merciful rain,

01:48.100 --> 01:53.470
although in Windland, it feels heavy and melancholy.

01:53.470 --> 01:57.030
I hope to see Grandfather Sun's face soon. Soon...

01:57.840 --> 02:01.960
Huh? Onii-chan, did you forgot to bring your umbrella?

02:03.500 --> 02:06.110
Which reminds me, it's been raining all day.

02:06.110 --> 02:08.000
You didn't bring it this morning?

02:08.000 --> 02:11.440
Ah, someone must have took mine by accident.

02:11.450 --> 02:14.060
Here

02:14.190 --> 02:19.200
If that's the case, let's share Filia's umbrella and go back together. Okay? Okay?

02:19.390 --> 02:20.880
Go back?

02:20.880 --> 02:23.160
It's okay if I'm only in the rain for a little.

02:23.160 --> 02:28.370
No! Your important first debut battle is coming and it'll be terrible if you catch a cold.

02:28.630 --> 02:29.900
But...

02:32.030 --> 02:33.040
Come in.

02:33.890 --> 02:36.400
It's fine, Priecia.

02:36.400 --> 02:38.320
Onii-chan can use my umbrella...

02:41.830 --> 02:43.300
My umbrella?!

02:43.800 --> 02:47.160
Let's share an umbrella to the girl's dormitory.

02:47.160 --> 02:48.870
K-Kagura...

02:50.130 --> 02:52.850
Onii-chan! Onii-chan!

02:52.850 --> 02:55.820
It won't be good if you catch a cold.

02:57.520 --> 02:58.440
Let's go.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.750
O-Okay!

03:02.110 --> 03:05.470
The Knights' First Battle

03:07.480 --> 03:10.960
Alright! Pay attention! Everyone please pay attention!

03:11.150 --> 03:12.330
Listen well.

03:12.330 --> 03:18.190
This will be the first actual combat training mission for all the knights who have passed their exam.

03:18.190 --> 03:24.010
The objective of this mission is to provide reinforcements for the soldiers at the Fortress of Grenzer.

03:24.490 --> 03:27.270
It is a fitting mission for a first actual combat training.

03:27.270 --> 03:29.480
Everyone do your best.

03:29.830 --> 03:32.470
During the training, if you happen to encounter an enemy,

03:32.470 --> 03:34.220
do not panic and start screaming.

03:34.220 --> 03:35.650
Follow the mission synopsis.

03:35.650 --> 03:38.940
First form a defensive formation together with your squad.

03:38.940 --> 03:41.460
Next, contact the instructor-in-charge, Instructor Karin,

03:41.460 --> 03:43.850
or the soldiers in the fortress.

03:43.850 --> 03:45.250
Understood?

03:45.250 --> 03:46.170
Even if you make a mistake...

03:46.170 --> 03:48.210
Actual combat... Actual combat... She talks incessantly.

03:48.210 --> 03:50.000
It can't be that bad.

03:50.000 --> 03:52.180
The truth is, it isn't really satisfying.

03:52.180 --> 03:56.860
It's only defending a village's fortress. It's too easy.

03:56.860 --> 03:58.160
Relaxing.

03:58.160 --> 04:01.480
Fool! It is not that easy.

04:01.480 --> 04:03.140
What do you mean?

04:03.140 --> 04:04.760
We have studied this in geography class.

04:05.160 --> 04:07.300
Where we are heading to, the Fortress of Grenzer,

04:07.300 --> 04:10.090
is in the contested territory with the Sablum Empire.

04:10.090 --> 04:15.190
In other words, that is one of Windland's final defensive lines.

04:17.070 --> 04:18.980
Geez, like I said...

04:18.980 --> 04:23.430
If this area gets taken down,
Windland won't have any escape route.

04:23.430 --> 04:25.990
And the battle will become even more intense.

04:25.990 --> 04:27.130
Ah, more intense...

04:28.650 --> 04:30.450
Is that how it is?

04:32.190 --> 04:35.340
You over there! Listen properly to the briefing!

04:35.340 --> 04:37.130
Y-Yes, Ma'am!

04:37.130 --> 04:40.630
If you aren't going to listen properly, I'm going to punish you all!

04:47.310 --> 04:49.900
Um... I...

04:51.580 --> 04:53.980
I'm sorry about what happened previously.

04:54.550 --> 04:56.020
You're sorry?

04:56.020 --> 04:59.360
Have you done anything that requires an apology?

04:59.970 --> 05:03.500
No... I mean...

05:03.500 --> 05:06.350
Previously... about... the date...

05:07.810 --> 05:10.250
I don't care about that anymore.

05:10.250 --> 05:10.990
Eh?

05:11.600 --> 05:12.980
Really.

05:12.980 --> 05:14.890
I don't care about it.

05:15.720 --> 05:19.530
So, you don't have to feel sorry.

05:19.530 --> 05:20.480
Just forget it.

05:21.130 --> 05:22.280
Okay.

05:22.280 --> 05:23.620
But that was surprising.

05:24.430 --> 05:27.750
When you suddenly said "Let's go back together,"

05:27.750 --> 05:29.390
I thought that...

05:29.560 --> 05:34.310
That's because I need to ask you something.

05:34.680 --> 05:38.180
What did you want to ask me about?

05:38.180 --> 05:40.320
Hyaweh, do you...

05:41.900 --> 05:43.990
like me?

05:44.120 --> 05:46.820
Like? What do you mean?

05:47.260 --> 05:51.560
Answer me. Do you love me?

05:58.670 --> 06:04.420
From now on, all of you will experience real-time combat — an actual battle.

06:05.320 --> 06:08.670
You, who have completed the harsh training,

06:08.670 --> 06:12.730
are Windland's proud and capable knights.

06:13.730 --> 06:15.940
There is nothing to be afraid of.

06:15.940 --> 06:17.570
Followers of Lelihion,

06:17.570 --> 06:22.770
it's time we take back our Holy Land, Resrexion, from Sablum's barbaric hands.

06:25.370 --> 06:26.880
Move out!

06:26.880 --> 06:27.860
Be alert!

06:31.270 --> 06:34.110
Have a safe trip, Lady Priecia!

06:34.110 --> 06:36.670
May you fight with honor, Lady Priecia!

06:36.670 --> 06:39.460
Hyaweh, good luck!

06:43.990 --> 06:47.670
All of you should never forget...

06:47.670 --> 06:50.360
Fighting for Lelihion,

06:50.360 --> 06:53.470
does not mean dying for Lelihion.

06:57.340 --> 07:00.480
Hey, Hyaweh, don't stop so suddenly.

07:01.080 --> 07:03.190
What's wrong? What are you looking at?

07:04.740 --> 07:05.700
Hyaweh.

07:10.110 --> 07:11.200
Hyaweh!

07:12.640 --> 07:14.030
Let's hurry up.

07:14.030 --> 07:14.780
Okay.

07:18.350 --> 07:19.530
Hey Fel...

07:20.840 --> 07:23.920
Fel, do you like me?

07:25.360 --> 07:28.090
About that... What do you mean? What do you mean?

07:28.220 --> 07:32.670
Don't tell me that you want to confirm what "love" is right now. Do you?!

07:32.670 --> 07:33.800
Are you listening?! Hey!

07:40.420 --> 07:42.470
Hey Bridget,

07:42.470 --> 07:43.930
are you sure you're okay?

07:43.930 --> 07:45.310
Your cough sounds bad.

07:47.700 --> 07:50.690
I'm sorry to make you worry about me, Filia.

07:51.600 --> 07:53.470
Catching a cold just before the first actual battle...

07:53.470 --> 07:58.270
That makes me such a useless knight. Useless.

07:58.910 --> 08:02.370
Don't push yourself. You should have stayed in bed.

08:04.280 --> 08:06.550
How could I? Lady Priecia and the others...

08:06.550 --> 08:09.950
Hyaweh and the others are out there battling for their lives,

08:10.560 --> 08:13.740
I can't just stay in bed.

08:14.630 --> 08:16.780
I have to at least be a medic,

08:16.780 --> 08:19.720
and assist those who are fighting.

08:22.540 --> 08:25.700
It doesn't seem to be a fever.

08:25.700 --> 08:27.380
What kind of sickness do you have?

08:29.060 --> 08:30.770
Don't come too close to me.

08:32.040 --> 08:36.370
U-Um... If you caught this cold, it would be bad. Very bad.

08:39.420 --> 08:42.190
Then I'll call you when we've reached the fortress.

08:42.190 --> 08:43.930
You should rest for a while.

08:43.930 --> 08:45.760
Sorry to trouble you. Sorry.

08:48.740 --> 08:52.320
That was close, my fake sickness
was nearly exposed. Nearly exposed.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.600
Even if it's a mission,

08:53.600 --> 08:58.630
I can't fight against my fellow Sablum comrades. Can't fight.

09:24.730 --> 09:28.670
Answer me. Do you love me?

09:31.720 --> 09:33.470
Wait a minute, Priecia.

09:33.470 --> 09:35.740
You're asking me this so suddenly.

09:35.740 --> 09:38.030
I... I'm puzzled.

09:39.250 --> 09:40.810
Just answer the question.

09:40.810 --> 09:44.520
This is something important. Very important.

09:44.520 --> 09:47.730
It's for the future of you and me.

09:47.820 --> 09:50.040
Priecia, I...

09:50.040 --> 09:55.020
I've never felt this way toward a girl before.

09:55.020 --> 09:57.520
This is my first time having such feelings.

09:58.440 --> 09:59.710
I might have...

10:01.620 --> 10:04.620
Since the first time we met...

10:06.190 --> 10:09.630
I love you so much, Priecia.

10:09.630 --> 10:11.890
You are the only one in my heart.

10:18.910 --> 10:22.630
So that's how it is. I understand your feelings.

10:22.630 --> 10:25.930
I shall then reply back to your feelings.

10:26.920 --> 10:27.840
I...

10:28.530 --> 10:29.880
hate you.

10:31.460 --> 10:34.280
Since the first time we met...

10:34.280 --> 10:36.370
Just like how much you love me,

10:36.370 --> 10:41.030
I hate you so much.

10:45.500 --> 10:47.570
Goodbye, Hyaweh.

11:21.810 --> 11:28.250
Everyone! We will be arriving at the Fortress of Grenzer soon.

11:28.460 --> 11:32.640
Please make sure to check your equipment.

11:33.250 --> 11:36.250
If anyone forgets something, I will punish them.

11:36.710 --> 11:39.260
This is a life-and-death matter.

11:49.810 --> 11:52.150
All units, dismount and line up!

11:59.710 --> 12:00.850
What's wrong?

12:02.500 --> 12:06.330
I just... don't... feel good.

12:07.130 --> 12:09.190
It could be car sickness.

12:11.150 --> 12:14.540
I have a bad feeling about this...

12:15.800 --> 12:20.320
Yes. The Pegasus Unit has safely
arrived at the Fortress of Grenzer.

12:20.320 --> 12:23.080
We'll report immediately to Captain Alex.

12:24.280 --> 12:25.130
What was that?

12:26.500 --> 12:28.310
Run... away...

12:29.730 --> 12:30.820
Captain Alex!

12:32.550 --> 12:33.590
You bastards!

12:36.420 --> 12:37.900
Sablum's ambush unit?

12:39.020 --> 12:41.180
Marquis! Level one emergency!

12:41.180 --> 12:44.090
The Fortress of Grenzer has fallen into Sablum's hands.

12:44.090 --> 12:47.910
Terminate the mission immediately! Marquis! Marquis!

12:49.750 --> 12:51.410
This isn't good.

12:56.550 --> 12:58.120
It's Sablum's army!

12:58.120 --> 12:59.420
Don't be afraid! Fight!

13:02.400 --> 13:04.490
What the hell is going on?

13:04.490 --> 13:07.140
Where did these enemies come from?

13:12.560 --> 13:13.690
Jung, hang in there.

13:15.090 --> 13:18.630
Please heed my call and gather in my hands.

13:18.630 --> 13:20.890
With the protection of the Earth Spirit...

13:20.890 --> 13:23.250
Stone Wall!

13:28.750 --> 13:29.660
Teacher!

13:30.510 --> 13:33.610
I have no idea what's happening, but enemies are coming out of the fortress.

13:33.610 --> 13:36.730
Gather the remaining forces and secure the escape route.

13:41.440 --> 13:43.170
Prism Bomb!

13:45.100 --> 13:46.380
Amazing.

13:58.680 --> 14:00.380
What's this? What's happening?

14:00.380 --> 14:03.820
What is going on?! Tell me, Bridget.

14:03.820 --> 14:06.040
It's an enemy attack. Enemy attack.

14:06.040 --> 14:11.450
We... No. This is Sablum's ambush attack. Ambush.

14:11.790 --> 14:15.200
But.. But... This is our allies' side.

14:15.200 --> 14:17.810
How did we get ambushed?

14:17.810 --> 14:18.460
Onii-chan.

14:19.370 --> 14:20.930
Stay behind cover!

14:20.930 --> 14:23.880
Stay there and don't move until I come and get you!

14:23.880 --> 14:24.670
Behind you!

14:27.030 --> 14:27.600
Bridget...

14:28.200 --> 14:30.360
I'll protect Filia.

14:30.360 --> 14:32.430
You don't have to worry. Don't worry.

14:33.300 --> 14:34.240
Thank you.

14:34.240 --> 14:35.930
Mibu style, hidden sword technique!

14:36.220 --> 14:37.160
Secret technique!

14:37.160 --> 14:39.690
Shin Ryuugazan!

14:37.160 --> 14:39.690
True Dragon Fang Slash

14:44.220 --> 14:45.670
Is everyone safe?

14:45.670 --> 14:48.660
Instructor, what's going on?

14:48.740 --> 14:50.530
It's an ambush.

14:50.530 --> 14:54.810
It's been confirmed that the Fortress of Grenzer has fallen into Sablum's hands.

14:55.510 --> 15:00.350
This means... Captain Alex and the soldiers in the fortress have already...

15:00.350 --> 15:04.170
My mission, now, is to lead you all to safety.

15:04.950 --> 15:08.010
And your mission, is to stay alive.

15:08.010 --> 15:10.680
Do not think about anything else.

15:10.990 --> 15:14.060
But there might be survivors.

15:14.060 --> 15:17.000
Waiting for reinforcements... Waiting for us.

15:17.940 --> 15:20.550
Instructor, are you going to abandon them?

15:20.550 --> 15:25.690
I will not obey. I will not obey such an absurd order.

15:26.230 --> 15:29.380
Shut up. The only reason you can say that...

15:29.380 --> 15:31.960
is because you aren't mature enough.

15:31.960 --> 15:33.690
Just follow the order.

15:34.600 --> 15:35.460
I refuse.

15:35.460 --> 15:36.550
What?

15:36.550 --> 15:40.830
Just like how you don't want us to die,

15:40.830 --> 15:44.000
I don't want the soldiers in the fortress to die.

15:44.670 --> 15:48.200
If my sword can save even one more life,

15:48.200 --> 15:51.020
that will be my reason to wield it.

15:51.020 --> 15:55.310
The one who taught us these morals of a knight...

15:55.950 --> 15:57.790
was you, Instructor.

15:59.830 --> 16:00.340
It's coming.

16:10.920 --> 16:11.590
An Angel.

16:19.140 --> 16:20.620
It's huge.

16:20.950 --> 16:24.130
That weapon... Ageheru.

16:24.130 --> 16:28.000
This means that this fortress was a sacrifice for that prototype.

16:28.160 --> 16:30.690
This place has been chosen as an experimental battleground.

16:40.110 --> 16:41.850
No... If that...

16:43.070 --> 16:43.900
Fel.

16:44.100 --> 16:45.910
That... That...

16:45.910 --> 16:48.020
I don't... don't want this!!

16:52.290 --> 16:54.490
No. No. No. No. No.

16:55.480 --> 16:56.660
No!

17:04.020 --> 17:08.040
<i>That... With that kind of firing, even our soldiers will...</i>

17:09.300 --> 17:15.050
<i>Bless us with Aruke's love. This must be a nightmare. It's just a dream. A dream.</i>

17:23.750 --> 17:25.610
Such a huge destructive power.

17:25.610 --> 17:27.770
Amazing. That's really amazing.

17:28.500 --> 17:29.680
Lady Priecia.

17:31.200 --> 17:32.520
Kagura.

17:32.520 --> 17:36.530
Steel defense wall. Can barely... hold up.

17:36.910 --> 17:38.830
Everyone. Is everyone alright?

17:42.020 --> 17:42.870
Thank goodness.

17:46.950 --> 17:48.080
An Angel...

17:48.080 --> 17:49.320
It can't be.

17:49.320 --> 17:52.330
Angels should be God's messengers.

17:52.330 --> 17:55.300
It can't be that kind of thing.

17:56.640 --> 17:57.640
That's right.

17:58.940 --> 18:03.520
That is Sablum's evil killing machine.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.780
Let's retreat.

18:05.780 --> 18:10.340
Judging from it's last attack, it should require some time to fire the next attack.

18:10.340 --> 18:12.030
There won't be another chance.

18:12.820 --> 18:14.360
Let's go, Priecia.

18:15.770 --> 18:17.600
Don't touch me!

18:17.600 --> 18:20.910
I told you before that I hate you!

18:21.000 --> 18:25.280
Fool! This isn't the time to be saying that.

18:25.280 --> 18:28.040
If you don't retreat... you'll die!

18:28.560 --> 18:29.880
It doesn't matter.

18:29.880 --> 18:35.430
Since the first day of my knighthood training,
I've been prepared to die.

18:35.430 --> 18:37.260
This is why I've trained so hard.

18:38.120 --> 18:39.870
You should escape while you still have the chance.

18:39.870 --> 18:41.690
I'll buy you some time.

18:42.460 --> 18:43.920
What are you saying?

18:43.920 --> 18:46.770
How can one person win against that kind of thing?

18:47.110 --> 18:48.110
Don't come any closer!

18:48.110 --> 18:48.960
Don't touch me!

18:48.960 --> 18:54.490
You're always like that. You don't even consider my feelings.

18:54.490 --> 18:55.730
You only care for yourself.

18:55.730 --> 18:58.940
You only care about me when it suits you.

19:00.080 --> 19:03.330
That's the way it is. That's how it is...

19:03.330 --> 19:06.450
Every time I needed someone to be beside me,

19:06.450 --> 19:09.540
you didn't do anything.

19:10.840 --> 19:11.890
Priecia!

19:12.790 --> 19:14.650
Lady Priecia...

19:20.680 --> 19:22.550
<i>It's better this way.</i>

19:24.430 --> 19:29.440
<i>At least this way, no one will be hurt because of me.</i>

19:32.480 --> 19:33.980
Don't be arrogant!

19:35.560 --> 19:37.700
Mirage Lash!

19:40.660 --> 19:41.730
What?!

19:41.730 --> 19:42.490
Not good!

19:43.050 --> 19:44.040
The attack is too shallow.

19:50.640 --> 19:51.500
Damn!

20:01.760 --> 20:02.530
Priecia!

20:03.900 --> 20:05.550
Hya... weh...

20:05.550 --> 20:07.150
Don't speak!

20:07.150 --> 20:09.990
Priecia, let's hurry to Kagura for medical treatment.

20:11.200 --> 20:11.690
Behind you.

20:16.790 --> 20:19.540
How dare you hurt Priecia...

20:22.200 --> 20:28.840
I, upon receiving my master's order, with the light in thy hand, defeat those with wings.

20:41.540 --> 20:44.200
He cut... the Angel.

20:44.200 --> 20:45.260
Onii-chan...

21:06.360 --> 21:08.240
Prie... cia...

21:19.760 --> 21:24.430
Amazing... That sword and Hyaweh are simply amazing.

21:24.430 --> 21:31.980
Lord Gerot, Cellima might just have found the true heir to the Windland. The true heir.

21:40.080 --> 21:42.700
<i>That's Ala-Gladius.</i>

21:42.700 --> 21:44.530
<i>The sword that kills Angels.</i>

21:56.000 --> 22:02.230
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.610 --> 22:09.050
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:09.050 --> 22:15.840
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.840 --> 22:22.530
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.770 --> 22:29.620
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.120 --> 22:37.620
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.620 --> 22:43.550
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.550 --> 22:50.820
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.130 --> 22:57.600
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.850 --> 23:05.050
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.870
Next Episode

23:15.940 --> 23:19.680
Eh? Priecia is missing?

23:19.680 --> 23:23.960
Seriously, she never does what she's told.

23:23.960 --> 23:26.520
This time she arbitrarily stayed out overnight again.

23:27.050 --> 23:29.480
Next, "Wandering Knights."

23:29.920 --> 23:32.790
Shine, the prism of heart!

23:34.350 --> 23:37.660
Priecia has become a bad girl! No way!!

23:34.510 --> 23:39.100
Wandering Knights
